        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "image_text_block_QCQJHR": {
      "type": "image-text-block",
      "name": "t:sections.image_text_block.presets.default.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/about4.jpg",
        "title": "",
        "description": "<div style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">The Creators</h3>\n  <br>\n  Cold ral is led by two brothers with different backgrounds and a shared refusal of the unnecessary. This dual perspective shapes a restrained approach to design. We create fewer pieces, but each one is designed with intent. The collections are unisex, monochrome and free of visible logos, allowing the garment to exist without imposed identity.\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Design and Development</h3>\n  <br>\n  Every cut, every proportion and every detail is the result of a methodical process carried out between Paris and our partner workshops. The goal is not to follow seasonal impulses, but to refine silhouettes that adapt naturally to everyday movement and modern life.\n</div>",
        "image_position": "right",
        "full_width": false,
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "image_text_block_ffwMyT": {
      "type": "image-text-block",
      "name": "t:sections.image_text_block.presets.default.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/about6.jpg",
        "title": "",
        "description": "<div style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Materials and Production</h3>\n  <br>\n  We work alongside textile specialists who share our commitment to quality, traceability and durability. Most of our fabrics are certified and selected for their structure, comfort and ability to endure over time. Materials are chosen with the same discipline as the designs themselves.\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Our Ethos</h3>\n  <br>\n  Our mission is simple. To build a reduced, coherent and durable wardrobe. Not to dress a single season, but to accompany a way of living. Cold ral evolves quietly, valuing structure, simplicity and consistency. A return to essential forms, reinterpreted for today.\n</div>",
        "image_position": "left",
        "full_width": false,
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 16
      }
